    "detailed_description": "Gloomfall is an <strong>Open World Dark Fantasy Action RPG with Roguelike elements</strong>, where you take the role of a hero, who <strong>travels through portals</strong> into unique, procedurally-generated worlds and biomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/1093be7186158c225d57601644d4c742.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=608 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/1093be7186158c225d57601644d4c742.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/1093be7186158c225d57601644d4c742.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move through portals into unique procedurally-generated worlds. It's up to you what you're going to do - Loot abandoned houses, defeat enemies, run to the nearest portal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYSTYLE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/a5d368435c0035591f3cec876e466fac.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=650 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/a5d368435c0035591f3cec876e466fac.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/a5d368435c0035591f3cec876e466fac.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find, buy or craft new equipment, and use it against your enemies! Choose your play style - Two-handed or one-handed warrior with a shield? Sneaky archer? Or maybe a small dagger to surprise your enemies in the darkness? It's up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSSES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/8a6cd5410bcb637f09085497808c2fd9.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=608 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/8a6cd5410bcb637f09085497808c2fd9.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/8a6cd5410bcb637f09085497808c2fd9.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Try beating bosses to gain experience and pride, if you dare!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EQUIPMENT AND HOUSES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/c85c402b4bb2f2466cc12d6d807e8369.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/c85c402b4bb2f2466cc12d6d807e8369.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/c85c402b4bb2f2466cc12d6d807e8369.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After collecting all those items, sell them to buy new items or even build your own house piece by piece!",
    "about_the_game": "Gloomfall is an <strong>Open World Dark Fantasy Action RPG with Roguelike elements</strong>, where you take the role of a hero, who <strong>travels through portals</strong> into unique, procedurally-generated worlds and biomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/1093be7186158c225d57601644d4c742.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=608 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/1093be7186158c225d57601644d4c742.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/1093be7186158c225d57601644d4c742.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move through portals into unique procedurally-generated worlds. It's up to you what you're going to do - Loot abandoned houses, defeat enemies, run to the nearest portal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYSTYLE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/a5d368435c0035591f3cec876e466fac.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=650 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/a5d368435c0035591f3cec876e466fac.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/a5d368435c0035591f3cec876e466fac.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find, buy or craft new equipment, and use it against your enemies! Choose your play style - Two-handed or one-handed warrior with a shield? Sneaky archer? Or maybe a small dagger to surprise your enemies in the darkness? It's up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSSES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/8a6cd5410bcb637f09085497808c2fd9.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=608 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/8a6cd5410bcb637f09085497808c2fd9.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/8a6cd5410bcb637f09085497808c2fd9.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Try beating bosses to gain experience and pride, if you dare!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EQUIPMENT AND HOUSES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/c85c402b4bb2f2466cc12d6d807e8369.poster.avif?t=1746099446\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/c85c402b4bb2f2466cc12d6d807e8369.webm?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/c85c402b4bb2f2466cc12d6d807e8369.mp4?t=1746099446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After collecting all those items, sell them to buy new items or even build your own house piece by piece!",
    "short_description": "Gloomfall is a dark fantasy open-world Roguelike game. Explore a diverse, procedurally generated open-world, learn unique skills, fight, complete objectives, craft, and trade.. Become the strongest hero, by defeating the most powerful forces of evil in each region.",
